sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as Command (RunE)
    participant V as Validate
    participant A as api.Client
    participant S as Martech API
    U->>C: flags and optional --file
    C->>C: build request from file, then changed flags
    C->>V: finalize (edit loop if --edit)
    V-->>C: request valid, or error before any network call
    C->>A: endpoint method with the request (wait=50 for score and optimize unless --async)
    loop up to 3 resends on 429 rate_limited or 503
        A->>S: HTTPS request with Bearer key
        S-->>A: status and body
    end
    A-->>C: Response with Status, Raw JSON and Value
    alt job still running after the wait and not --async
        loop every 2 s until done or --timeout
            C->>A: Job(id)
            A->>S: GET /v1/jobs/id
            S-->>A: job status
        end
    end
    C-->>U: text table or raw JSON on stdout
    Note over C,U: banner, progress and errors go to stderr
